beellama.cpp - https://github.com/Anbeeld/beellama.cpp

The KVarN KV-cache record format (128-token Hadamard-rotated records with
three fp16 axis vectors, an fp16 attention sink and precision tail) and its
width names are reimplemented in gmlx/cache/kvarn_cache.py and
gmlx/cache/kvarn_sdpa.py from beellama.cpp's kvarn implementation. The
method is Huawei's KVarN (arXiv:2606.03458). beellama.cpp is a fork of
llama.cpp distributed under the MIT License:

